	measure 'Retention Security' = ```
			
			
			var RetName = 
			        SWITCH(CALCULATE([Amount_Int], 'Metric'[Metric Name] = "RetentionSecurityType"),
			            0, "No Retention",
			            2, "Retention, No Bank Guarantee",
			            3, "Retention with a Bank Guarantee",
			            SWITCH(CALCULATE([Amount_Int], 'Metric'[Metric Name] = "RetentionType"),
			                1, "Original Contract Sum",
			                2, "Adjusted Contract Sum",
			                BLANK()
			            )
			        )
			RETURN RetName
			```
		lineageTag: 6a9c69e1-7b67-4a13-9cca-dff078621afe

